{"3223050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MinerMancers", "steam_appid": 3223050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MinerMancers is a co-op action game about under-appreciated wizards going mining together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/2ed2e2b095b4e72032c4aa2d0cc3fbbe.poster.avif?t=1781207507\" width=638 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/2ed2e2b095b4e72032c4aa2d0cc3fbbe.webm?t=1781207507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/2ed2e2b095b4e72032c4aa2d0cc3fbbe.mp4?t=1781207507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into dangerous caves alone or with up to 3 friends (similarly oppressed wizard co-workers), to mine for the resources demanded by your employer, the globe-spanning <strong>MinerMancers Inc</strong> - which is not <i>technically</i> an evil entity, on account of being too bureaucratic for actual malice to fully manifest before being consumed by a roving meeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/ddd0f76783cb774e72cabc4b739c7abe.poster.avif?t=1781207507\" width=638 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/ddd0f76783cb774e72cabc4b739c7abe.webm?t=1781207507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/ddd0f76783cb774e72cabc4b739c7abe.mp4?t=1781207507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to fight or avoid creatures that don't take kindly to even the most nattily-dressed wizard wandering around their caves digging things up. So choose your spells wisely, and above all look after <strong>yourself and your friends</strong>; because the company sure isn't going to! Magical healing might be miraculous, but have you seen how much it <i>costs</i> these days??</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/1503a05110a2138a6f0b6f60e5930179.poster.avif?t=1781207507\" width=638 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/1503a05110a2138a6f0b6f60e5930179.webm?t=1781207507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/1503a05110a2138a6f0b6f60e5930179.mp4?t=1781207507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do well on a mission though, and you might come out of it with the extra gold you need to buy that new hat you've had your eye on. Or perhaps that fancy new beard, the one with the gold rings in it? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sure, you may be a bottom-rung wizard with terrible health coverage and an employment contract that <i>might</i> have been written by actual demons; HR don't do in-person meetings, and there's an odd smell outside their - always locked - office. But, the one thing you can definitely control is how <i>good</i> you look doing it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/7431d15ff372cbda19a07f2558c0b94e.poster.avif?t=1781207507\" width=308 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/7431d15ff372cbda19a07f2558c0b94e.webm?t=1781207507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/7431d15ff372cbda19a07f2558c0b94e.mp4?t=1781207507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MinerMancers is a co-op action game about under-appreciated wizards going mining together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/2ed2e2b095b4e72032c4aa2d0cc3fbbe.poster.avif?t=1781207507\" width=638 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/2ed2e2b095b4e72032c4aa2d0cc3fbbe.webm?t=1781207507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/2ed2e2b095b4e72032c4aa2d0cc3fbbe.mp4?t=1781207507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into dangerous caves alone or with up to 3 friends (similarly oppressed wizard co-workers), to mine for the resources demanded by your employer, the globe-spanning <strong>MinerMancers Inc</strong> - which is not <i>technically</i> an evil entity, on account of being too bureaucratic for actual malice to fully manifest before being consumed by a roving meeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/ddd0f76783cb774e72cabc4b739c7abe.poster.avif?t=1781207507\" width=638 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/ddd0f76783cb774e72cabc4b739c7abe.webm?t=1781207507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/ddd0f76783cb774e72cabc4b739c7abe.mp4?t=1781207507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to fight or avoid creatures that don't take kindly to even the most nattily-dressed wizard wandering around their caves digging things up. So choose your spells wisely, and above all look after <strong>yourself and your friends</strong>; because the company sure isn't going to! Magical healing might be miraculous, but have you seen how much it <i>costs</i> these days??</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/1503a05110a2138a6f0b6f60e5930179.poster.avif?t=1781207507\" width=638 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/1503a05110a2138a6f0b6f60e5930179.webm?t=1781207507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/1503a05110a2138a6f0b6f60e5930179.mp4?t=1781207507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do well on a mission though, and you might come out of it with the extra gold you need to buy that new hat you've had your eye on. Or perhaps that fancy new beard, the one with the gold rings in it? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sure, you may be a bottom-rung wizard with terrible health coverage and an employment contract that <i>might</i> have been written by actual demons; HR don't do in-person meetings, and there's an odd smell outside their - always locked - office. But, the one thing you can definitely control is how <i>good</i> you look doing it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/7431d15ff372cbda19a07f2558c0b94e.poster.avif?t=1781207507\" width=308 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/7431d15ff372cbda19a07f2558c0b94e.webm?t=1781207507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/extras/7431d15ff372cbda19a07f2558c0b94e.mp4?t=1781207507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "MinerMancers is a co-op action game about under-appreciated wizards going mining together. You and up to 3 friends will cast spells, mine resources, fight monsters, and above all get back alive so you can spend your earnings on new hats, robes and beards.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/23a6ffc5aebdb2f17cd93e5c525b2c658c41a324/header.jpg?t=1781207507", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/c044a4ea53209fe2050b32464192fbd8691129d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781207507", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223050/c044a4ea53209fe2050b32464192fbd8691129d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781207507", "website": "https://www.minermancers.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4-core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<